  "definition": "Emergency Assistance",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-07-01",
  "expirationDate": "2035-07-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #5370, eff 4-13-92; amd by #6672, eff 1-26-98; ss by #6754, eff 5-20-98; amd by #7206, eff 3-1-00; amd by #7415, EMERGENCY, eff 12-15-00, EXPIRED: 6-13-01; ss by #7497, eff 6-14-01; amd by #7714, eff 7-1-02; paragraphs (j)-(k) amd by #8740, INTERIM, eff 10-13-06, EXPIRED: 4-11-07; paragraphs (j)-(k) amd by #8869, eff 4-19-07; paragraph (h) amd by #9300, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-21-08, EXPIRES: 4-19-09; ss by #9434, eff 4-1-09; amd by #9642, eff 2-1-10; ss by #10860, eff 6-30-15; amd by #12697, eff 12-31-18; ss by #14299, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
